# 🔥 EvalForge — Implementation Plan

> **LLM Evaluation, Benchmarking & Hallucination Detection Platform**

---

## 📋 Project Summary

EvalForge is a production-grade system that evaluates, benchmarks, and improves LLM outputs by detecting hallucinations, measuring semantic accuracy, evaluating RAG pipelines, and comparing multiple LLMs across performance, cost, and latency.

---

## 🏗️ Architecture Overview

```mermaid
graph TD
    A[React + TypeScript Frontend] -->|REST API| B[FastAPI Backend]
    B --> C[Evaluation Engine]
    C --> D[Embedding Model - Sentence Transformers]
    C --> E[LLM APIs - Gemini / OpenAI]
    C --> F[Scoring Engine]
    B --> G[Database - SQLite/PostgreSQL]
    A --> H[Dashboard - Recharts]
    B --> I[Dataset Manager - CSV/JSON]
```

---

