## 🚀 Phased Build Plan

### Phase 1: Project Setup & Backend Foundation
| Task | Details |
|------|---------|
| Initialize backend | FastAPI project with proper structure |
| Initialize frontend | Vite + React + TypeScript + Tailwind CSS |
| Set up database | SQLite for MVP (upgrade to PostgreSQL later) |
| Configure CORS | Cross-origin for frontend ↔ backend |
| Environment config | `.env` for API keys (Gemini, OpenAI) |

### Phase 2: Core Evaluation Engine
| Task | Details |
|------|---------|
| Embedding service | Sentence Transformers for semantic embeddings |
| Semantic similarity scoring | Cosine similarity between expected & actual outputs |
| Relevance scoring | Embedding-based relevance to context |
| Hallucination detection | Context grounding verification + embedding checks |
| Scoring engine | Composite scoring with weighted metrics |

### Phase 3: Multi-Model Benchmarking
| Task | Details |
|------|---------|
| Gemini API integration | Google Generative AI SDK |
| OpenAI API integration | OpenAI SDK |
| Benchmark runner | Run same prompts across models, collect metrics |
| Metrics collection | Accuracy, latency, cost per token |
| Comparison engine | Side-by-side model comparison |

### Phase 4: RAG Evaluation System
| Task | Details |
|------|---------|
| Retrieval quality scoring | Precision/recall of retrieved documents |
| Context relevance scoring | Semantic similarity to query |
| Grounding score | Output grounded in retrieved context |
| End-to-end RAG metrics | Combined retrieval + generation quality |

### Phase 5: Dataset Management
| Task | Details |
|------|---------|
| CSV/JSON upload | File upload + parsing endpoints |
| Dataset storage | Store & manage evaluation datasets |
| Real dataset integration | SQuAD sample + TruthfulQA sample |
| Dataset preview | View uploaded data in frontend |

### Phase 6: Web Dashboard (Frontend)
| Task | Details |
|------|---------|
| Premium UI design | Dark mode, glassmorphism, gradients |
| Evaluation form | Prompt + Context + Expected Output input |
| Score visualization | Recharts bar/radar/line charts |
| Model comparison view | Side-by-side metrics with charts |
| Dataset uploader | Drag-and-drop CSV/JSON upload |
| Error distribution charts | Hallucination type breakdown |
| Real-time results | Live evaluation result display |

### Phase 7: Polish & Deploy
| Task | Details |
|------|---------|
| Docker setup | Containerize backend |
| Architecture diagram | Generate architecture.png |
| README | Comprehensive documentation |
| Deploy | Vercel (frontend) + Render (backend) |

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

| Layer | Technology |
|-------|-----------|
| **Backend** | Python 3.11+, FastAPI, Uvicorn |
| **ML/AI** | Sentence Transformers, HuggingFace, LangChain |
| **LLM APIs** | Google Gemini API, OpenAI API |
| **Frontend** | React 18, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, Vite |
| **Charts** | Recharts |
| **Database** | SQLite (MVP) → PostgreSQL |
| **Infra** | Docker, Vercel, Render |

---

## 🎯 Success Metrics

| Metric | Target |
|--------|--------|
| Semantic evaluation accuracy | ≥ 85% |
| Hallucination detection precision | ≥ 70% |
| Average response latency | ≤ 300ms |
| Dataset size support | ≥ 1,000 samples |

---

## ⚡ MVP Scope (What We Build First)

1. ✅ Evaluation API (semantic similarity + relevance scoring)
2. ✅ Embedding similarity scoring engine
3. ✅ Basic hallucination detection
4. ✅ CSV dataset upload & parsing
5. ✅ Interactive dashboard with score visualization
6. ✅ Single model evaluation flow (Gemini)

---

## 🔮 Advanced Features (Post-MVP)

- Prompt optimization suggestions
- Auto dataset generation
- Fine-tuning recommendations
- Multi-agent evaluation system
- Redis caching for repeated evaluations

